- Existing routes and components.
- Existing state management.
- Existing authentication.
- Existing database and storage.
- Existing API integrations.
- Existing deployment configuration.
- Existing implementation quality and limitations.

Where the two differ, report the difference. Do not change the product specification to match an accidental limitation of the existing prototype.

