- Basic achievements.
- Contribution records.
- Personal progression dashboard.
- Basic Leaderboards.
- House rankings.

Future:

- Advanced seasonal competitions.
- Advanced reward catalogue.
- Tangible reward integrations.
- On-chain XP or tokenisation.

