# 17. Final product definition

The Arena is one unified community and contribution ecosystem.

Visitors become Spartans.

Spartans discover and develop through Houses, Academy, missions and events.

Members contribute work and submit proof.

Approved contributions create records, recognition and XP.

XP supports both progression and internal exchange.

Numerical levels represent accumulated Lifetime XP.

Ascendancy represents recognised leadership and responsibility.

Permissions govern what members can actually do.

Leaderboards recognise verified contributions.

Organisations can participate as sponsors and project identities.

The shared application shell connects the entire experience across desktop, tablet and mobile.

The platform should help members learn, discover, build, contribute and grow — while giving The Arena the systems needed to recognise meaningful work and coordinate a growing community.

**This specification is the product baseline against which the existing repository must now be audited.**